        "text": "Synthetic policy 1 / 合成政策",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 0
        },
        "style": "Title"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_c9ea8fe3fa0cce91079bc97f",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "员工入职的提交期限为16个工作日。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 1
        },
        "style": "Heading 2"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_e9e857338f967c1e5e0a5aa2",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "员工入职的审批责任人为人事。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 2
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_13f4dc3867bac60fb668ade9",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "员工入职必须提供劳动合同。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 3
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_baec5c7fa8ea64aa1709bdc4",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "员工入职记录须保留9个月。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 4
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_345bccf9abab4198053de2aa",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "员工入职的紧急例外需要部门负责人书面批准。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 5
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_f1392fc842dcd294bc912c93",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "员工入职必须通过员工平台提交。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 6
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
